{% comment %}
  TRYMALORA - EDITORIAL PRODUCT FAQ (TASKS 14 & 15)
  Refined accordion layout matching ShopSideK T01 styling.
  Thin pink dividers, circular rotating plus/minus icons, and concise answers.
{% endcomment %}

<style>
  .tm-faq-section {
    padding: 72px 0;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--zv-pdp-line, #EAD7DD);
    font-family: var(--zv-font-body, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif);
    color: var(--zv-pdp-text, #2B1B24);
  }

  .tm-faq-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
  }

  .tm-faq-chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 5px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--zv-radius-full, 9999px);
    background: var(--zv-pdp-tint, #F8E4EB);
    color: var(--zv-pdp-accent, #B0476E);
    border: 1px solid var(--zv-pdp-line, #EAD7DD);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .tm-faq-title {
    font-family: var(--zv-font-heading, 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif);
    font-size: 34px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--zv-pdp-heading, #2B1B24);
    line-height: 1.18;
    letter-spacing: -0.6px;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 768px) {
    .tm-faq-title {
      font-size: 38px;
    }
  }

  .tm-faq-subtitle {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--zv-pdp-body, #4A3841);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .tm-faq-list {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--zv-pdp-line, #EAD7DD);
  }

  .tm-faq-item {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--zv-pdp-line, #EAD7DD);
  }

  .tm-faq-summary {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 18px 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--zv-pdp-heading, #2B1B24);
    cursor: pointer;
    user-select: none;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .tm-faq-summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .tm-faq-summary:hover {
    color: var(--zv-pdp-accent, #B0476E);
  }

  .tm-faq-ic {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--zv-pdp-tint, #F8E4EB);
    color: var(--zv-pdp-accent, #B0476E);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-left: 16px;
  }

  .tm-faq-item[open] .tm-faq-ic {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    background: var(--zv-pdp-accent, #B0476E);
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .tm-faq-body {
    padding: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--zv-pdp-body, #4A3841);
  }
</style>

<section class="tm-faq-section" id="tmFaqSection">
  <div class="zv-container" style="max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px;">

    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="tm-faq-header">
      <span class="tm-faq-chip">
        ✦ COMMON QUESTIONS
      </span>
      <h2 class="tm-faq-title">
        Frequently Asked Questions
      </h2>
      <p class="tm-faq-subtitle">
        Everything you need to know about safety, multiplayer game rules, battery setup, and shipping policies.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Accordion List -->
    <div class="tm-faq-list">

      <details class="tm-faq-item" open>
        <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
          <span>Is the infrared beam safe for children and eyes?</span>
          <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="tm-faq-body">
          Yes. The set utilizes certified optical infrared emission—the same safe, invisible light technology found in standard home TV remote controls. There are no hazardous high-powered laser diodes and zero physical dart or plastic projectiles, ensuring 100% eye-safe indoor family play.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="tm-faq-item">
        <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
          <span>What batteries are required and are they included?</span>
          <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="tm-faq-body">
          Batteries are not included in the standard retail box. Each set of 2 blasters requires 4 × 1.5V AAA batteries (2 per blaster), and the target projector requires 3 × 1.5V AA batteries. We suggest fresh alkaline batteries to ensure maximum sensor distance and vibrant wall projections.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="tm-faq-item">
        <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
          <span>Can more than 2 players battle together?</span>
          <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="tm-faq-body">
          Yes! By selecting the 2-pack (4 blasters) or 3-pack (6 blasters) bundle offers, you can sync unlimited blasters together across 4 distinct team color channels (Blue, Red, Green, White). Teammates on the same color frequency cannot damage each other, allowing coordinated group squad matches.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="tm-faq-item">
        <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
          <span>How does the wall-target projector operate?</span>
          <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="tm-faq-body">
          Place the projector on a table or the floor pointed at any light wall or ceiling in a slightly dimmed room. When switched on, it projects moving animated targets across 180° of elevation. Players aim and fire at the projections—hits register with distinct arcade sounds and flashing hit lights.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="tm-faq-item">
        <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
          <span>What is your dispatch timeline and return policy?</span>
          <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="tm-faq-body">
          Orders are packed and dispatched from regional US distribution hubs within 24–48 business hours with tracked delivery. We back every order with a 30-day money-back guarantee for complete peace of mind.
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Trymalora Product FAQ",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Trymalora Product FAQ"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
